{"id":"9618eeaafca311ce","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-levy-lifted-reduction.md","title":"边扩展后Lévy提升与label-trace","display":"df-levy-lifted-reduction — 边扩展后Lévy提升与label-trace","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-levy-lifted-reduction","aliases":["56-df-levy-lifted-reduction"],"display":"df-levy-lifted-reduction — 边扩展后Lévy提升与label-trace","depends_on":["[[56-df-edge-expanded-reduction]]","[[56-df-levy-rule-lifting]]","[[56-lem-levy-lifting]]"],"source_section":"§8.6 Definitions 8.6.59,8.6.69,8.6.72","source_printed_pages":"408,412–413","source_statement_status":"compared-to-local-djvu-ocr; selected-source-pages-rendered; explicit-coding-local","source_proof_status":"source-argument-expanded-in-Remark; not-machine-formalized"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-levy-lifted-reduction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-levy-lifted-reduction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-levy-lifted-reduction — 边扩展后Lévy提升与label-trace"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"be44d5d262d8e4c8\" href=\"?note=be44d5d262d8e4c8\" title=\"56-df-edge-expanded-reduction\">56-df-edge-expanded-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b2ae6f5d85c77f9b\" href=\"?note=b2ae6f5d85c77f9b\" title=\"56-df-levy-rule-lifting\">56-df-levy-rule-lifting</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e1df6cfb55a11bcc\" href=\"?note=e1df6cfb55a11bcc\" title=\"56-lem-levy-lifting\">56-lem-levy-lifting</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§8.6 Definitions 8.6.59,8.6.69,8.6.72"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"408,412–413"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"compared-to-local-djvu-ocr; selected-source-pages-rendered; explicit-coding-local"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source-argument-expanded-in-Remark; not-machine-formalized"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"be44d5d262d8e4c8\" href=\"?note=be44d5d262d8e4c8\" title=\"56-df-edge-expanded-reduction\">56-df-edge-expanded-reduction</a> 的左线性系统、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E,R^e,\\mathcal C,\\operatorname{Exp},\\operatorname{Rep},\\operatorname{epos},\\operatorname{Vis}\">\\(\\mathcal E,R^e,\\mathcal C,\\operatorname{Exp},\\operatorname{Rep},\\operatorname{epos},\\operatorname{Vis}\\)</span>。标记项、原子符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>、复杂符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>、子标签关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubLabel}\">\\(\\operatorname{SubLabel}\\)</span>、擦除 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{erase}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{erase}_L\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b2ae6f5d85c77f9b\" href=\"?note=b2ae6f5d85c77f9b\" title=\"56-df-levy-rule-lifting\">56-df-levy-rule-lifting</a>；路径提升及合法性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e1df6cfb55a11bcc\" href=\"?note=e1df6cfb55a11bcc\" title=\"56-lem-levy-lifting\">56-lem-levy-lifting</a>。这些标签构造以下均实例化于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^e\">\\(R^e\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R\">\\(\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\operatorname{Exp}(\\operatorname{src}(\\rho))\">\\(X\\in\\operatorname{Exp}(\\operatorname{src}(\\rho))\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in T_{R^e}^L\">\\(M\\in T_{R^e}^L\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{erase}_L(M)=X\">\\(\\operatorname{erase}_L(M)=X\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\\in\\operatorname{Vis}(\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)),w\\in\\operatorname{Vis}(\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho))\">\\(z\\in\\operatorname{Vis}(\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)),w\\in\\operatorname{Vis}(\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho))\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(i\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ELift}_R(M,\\rho)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{LPath}_{R^e}(M,\\operatorname{EPath}_R(\\operatorname{erase}_L(M),\\rho)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ELift}_R(M,\\rho)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{LPath}_{R^e}(M,\\operatorname{EPath}_R(\\operatorname{erase}_L(M),\\rho)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LevyLift}_R(\\rho)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ELift}_R(\\operatorname{LInit}_{R^e}(\\mathcal E(\\operatorname{src}(\\rho))),\\rho),\\qquad\\operatorname{LTgt}_R(\\rho)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{tgt}(\\operatorname{LevyLift}_R(\\rho)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{LevyLift}_R(\\rho)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ELift}_R(\\operatorname{LInit}_{R^e}(\\mathcal E(\\operatorname{src}(\\rho))),\\rho),\\qquad\\operatorname{LTgt}_R(\\rho)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{tgt}(\\operatorname{LevyLift}_R(\\rho)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LTr}_R(\\rho,z,w)\\iff\\exists q\\in\\operatorname{Rep}_{\\operatorname{erase}_L(\\operatorname{LTgt}_R(\\rho))}(w)\\;\\operatorname{SubLabel}_{R^e}\\bigl(A(\\mathcal E(\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)),\\operatorname{epos}_{\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)}(z)),\\operatorname{LTgt}_R(\\rho)(q)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{LTr}_R(\\rho,z,w)\\iff\\exists q\\in\\operatorname{Rep}_{\\operatorname{erase}_L(\\operatorname{LTgt}_R(\\rho))}(w)\\;\\operatorname{SubLabel}_{R^e}\\bigl(A(\\mathcal E(\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)),\\operatorname{epos}_{\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)}(z)),\\operatorname{LTgt}_R(\\rho)(q)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ELift}_R(M,\\rho)\\in\\mathcal F_{(R^e)^L},\\qquad\\ell(\\operatorname{ELift}_R(M,\\rho))=\\ell(\\rho),\\qquad\\operatorname{src}(\\operatorname{ELift}_R(M,\\rho))=M.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ELift}_R(M,\\rho)\\in\\mathcal F_{(R^e)^L},\\qquad\\ell(\\operatorname{ELift}_R(M,\\rho))=\\ell(\\rho),\\qquad\\operatorname{src}(\\operatorname{ELift}_R(M,\\rho))=M.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C(\\operatorname{erase}_L(\\operatorname{tgt}(\\operatorname{ELift}_R(M,\\rho))))=\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal C(\\operatorname{erase}_L(\\operatorname{tgt}(\\operatorname{ELift}_R(M,\\rho))))=\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ELift}_R(M,\\rho)|_i=\\operatorname{ELift}_R(M,\\rho|_i)\\quad(i\\le\\ell(\\rho)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ELift}_R(M,\\rho)|_i=\\operatorname{ELift}_R(M,\\rho|_i)\\quad(i\\le\\ell(\\rho)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LevyLift}_R(\\rho)|_i=\\operatorname{LevyLift}_R(\\rho|_i)\\quad(i\\le\\ell(\\rho)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{LevyLift}_R(\\rho)|_i=\\operatorname{LevyLift}_R(\\rho|_i)\\quad(i\\le\\ell(\\rho)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ELift}_R(M,\\rho;\\eta)=\\operatorname{ELift}_R(M,\\rho);\\operatorname{ELift}_R(\\operatorname{tgt}(\\operatorname{ELift}_R(M,\\rho)),\\eta)\\quad(\\eta\\in\\mathcal F_R,\\ \\operatorname{src}(\\eta)=\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ELift}_R(M,\\rho;\\eta)=\\operatorname{ELift}_R(M,\\rho);\\operatorname{ELift}_R(\\operatorname{tgt}(\\operatorname{ELift}_R(M,\\rho)),\\eta)\\quad(\\eta\\in\\mathcal F_R,\\ \\operatorname{src}(\\eta)=\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>ELift先从已有边展开源继续扩展原路径，再从已有标记项继续Lévy标记，两个阶段都继承中间历史。LevyLift只是以规范边展开和原子初标为源的特殊情形。它与直接在R中LPath不同：collapsing规则新产生的e顶点接收复杂历史，原步骤不会在提升时丢失。</p>\n<p>LTr通过目标边栈中“存在一个代表”表达原边上的历史，不把多个e标签合成一个未经定义的新标签。规范源epos唯一；目标Rep可以多元。输入和代表都在明确函数域内，LTr是谓词展开。ELift合法性、擦除、前缀与拼接律由两个已核对提升的相应规律依次复合；特别是拼接时不重新初始化标签。</p>\n<p>原书8.6.69明确规定lifting等于expansion后labelling；8.6.72经多重边塌缩定义expanded positions。此处Rep给出同一塌缩的有限树实现，仅处理函数顶点与全部边；未标记变量顶点被显式排除。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-edge-expanded-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"be44d5d262d8e4c8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-edge-expanded-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-levy-rule-lifting","status":"resolved","id":"b2ae6f5d85c77f9b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[