 E,R^e,\\mathcal C,\\operatorname{Exp},\\operatorname{Rep},\\operatorname{epos},\\operatorname{Vis}$。标记项、原子符号 $A$、复杂符号 $C$、子标签关系 $\\operatorname{SubLabel}$、擦除 $\\operatorname{erase}_L$ 见 [[56-df-levy-rule-lifting]]；路径提升及合法性见 [[56-lem-levy-lifting]]。这些标签构造以下均实例化于 $R^e$。$\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R$；$X\\in\\operatorname{Exp}(\\operatorname{src}(\\rho))$；$M\\in T_{R^e}^L$ 满足 $\\operatorname{erase}_L(M)=X$；$z\\in\\operatorname{Vis}(\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)),w\\in\\operatorname{Vis}(\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho))$；$i\\in\\mathbb N$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E,R^e,\\mathcal C,\\operatorname{Exp},\\operatorname{Rep},\\operatorname{epos},\\operatorname{Vis}","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SubLabel}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{erase}_L","display":false},{"tex":"R^e","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in\\operatorname{Exp}(\\operatorname{src}(\\rho))","display":false},{"tex":"M\\in T_{R^e}^L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{erase}_L(M)=X","display":false},{"tex":"z\\in\\operatorname{Vis}(\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)),w\\in\\operatorname{Vis}(\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho))","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ELift}_R(M,\\rho)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{LPath}_{R^e}(M,\\operatorname{EPath}_R(\\operatorname{erase}_L(M),\\rho)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LevyLift}_R(\\rho)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ELift}_R(\\operatorname{LInit}_{R^e}(\\mathcal E(\\operatorname{src}(\\rho))),\\rho),\\qquad\\operatorname{LTgt}_R(\\rho)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{tgt}(\\operatorname{LevyLift}_R(\\rho)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LTr}_R(\\rho,z,w)\\iff\\exists q\\in\\operatorname{Rep}_{\\operatorname{erase}_L(\\operatorname{LTgt}_R(\\rho))}(w)\\;\\operatorname{SubLabel}_{R^e}\\bigl(A(\\mathcal E(\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)),\\operatorname{epos}_{\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)}(z)),\\operatorname{LTgt}_R(\\rho)(q)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ELift}_R(M,\\rho)\\in\\mathcal F_{(R^e)^L},\\qquad\\ell(\\operatorname{ELift}_R(M,\\rho))=\\ell(\\rho),\\qquad\\operatorname{src}(\\operatorname{ELift}_R(M,\\rho))=M.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal C(\\operatorname{erase}_L(\\operatorname{tgt}(\\operatorname{ELift}_R(M,\\rho))))=\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ELift}_R(M,\\rho)|_i=\\operatorname{ELift}_R(M,\\rho|_i)\\quad(i\\le\\ell(\\rho)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LevyLift}_R(\\rho)|_i=\\operatorname{LevyLift}_R(\\rho|_i)\\quad(i\\le\\ell(\\rho)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ELift}_R(M,\\rho;\\eta)=\\operatorname{ELift}_R(M,\\rho);\\operatorname{ELift}_R(\\operatorname{tgt}(\\operatorname{ELift}_R(M,\\rho)),\\eta)\\quad(\\eta\\in\\mathcal F_R,\\ \\operatorname{src}(\\eta)=\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho)).","display":true}],"bytes":3764,"backlinks":[{"id":"803b6c844379847d","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用 [[56-df-levy-lifted-reduction]] 的左线性系统，$R^e$ 为边扩展规则，$T^e$ 为扩展项集。$\\boldsymbol s\\in T^{\\mathbb N}$、$\\boldsymbol u\\in\\mathcal E_R^{\\mathbb N}$ 满足 $\\operatorname{InfRed}_R(\\boldsymbol s,\\boldsymbol u)$，路径前缀、步及端点见 [[56-df-labelled-reduction]]。$\\pi_2(s,u,t)=u$ 为三元组的第二投影。$\\operatorname{EPath}_R$ 见 [[56-df-edge-expanded-reduction]]，标记提升的前缀一致性见 [[56-lem-levy-lifting]]；$\\mathcal I_{R^e}^{\\mathrm L}$ 是 [[56-df-levy-family-development]] 在扩展系统上的合法无限标记步接口。$\\operatorname{erase}_L,\\operatorname{LStep}_{R^e}$ 均取展开系统的Lévy实例。下面构造的函数仅在上述合法无限路径域上定义。"},{"id":"98c4988827e6b3ed","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"取 $\\Sigma=(\\{c\\},\\{(c,1)\\})$、不同变量 $x,y\\in\\mathcal V$、$R=\\{(c(x),x)\\}$。新的边符号e及 $\\mathcal E,R^e$、Lévy提升见 [[56-df-levy-lifted-reduction]]；直接在R中标记的路径见 [[56-df-levy-rule-lifting]]；trace对应见 [[56-thm-label-trace]]。$\\epsilon=()$，$\\iota_1=(1)\\in W$，$\\iota_{11}=(1,1)\\in W$。"},{"id":"70e3cea5c0444e2c","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定正交TRS。$\\rho,\\eta\\in\\mathcal F_R$ 共源，且 $\\mathrm{NF}(T,\\to_R,\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho))$、$\\mathrm{NF}(T,\\to_R,\\operatorname{tgt}(\\eta))$。$\\operatorname{LevyLift}_R,\\operatorname{LTgt}_R$ 见 [[56-df-levy-lifted-reduction]]；边展开的置换保持见 [[56-prop-edge-expansion-preservation]]，Lévy标记的置换保持见 [[56-lem-levy-permutation]]。共初正规形路径的置换等价见 [[56-cor-normal-form-permutation-equivalence]]。"},{"id":"a5d902ff11f12c47","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用 [[56-df-levy-lifted-reduction]] 的左线性系统。$\\rho=(\\langle s_0,\\ldots,s_n\\rangle,\\langle u_0,\\ldots,u_{n-1}\\rangle)\\in\\mathcal F_R$，$i\\in\\mathbb N$、$i<n$。$\\operatorname{EPath}_R(\\rho)=(\\langle X_0,\\ldots,X_n\\rangle,\\langle v_0,\\ldots,v_{n-1}\\rangle)$；$\\operatorname{LevyLift}_R(\\rho)=(\\langle M_0,\\ldots,M_n\\rangle,\\langle w_0,\\ldots,w_{n-1}\\rangle)$。令 $\\operatorname{Deg}_{R^e}(M_i,v_i)=(\\lambda_i,\\ell_i)$、$\\lambda_i=(L_i,H_i)\\in R^e$。$\\operatorname{TN},\\operatorname{TPos}$ 见 [[56-df-trace-ancestors]]，路径切片、见证见 [[56-df-proofterm-embedding]]。单函数顶点样本的Pattern祖先闭合见 [[56-lem-slice-ancestor]]，在展开系统上实例化。$C(\\lambda_i,\\ell_i,b)$ 以及SubLabel均是展开系统的标签。原系统与展开系统间的 trace 对应见 [[56-lem-edge-expansion-traces]]；已有标签沿非collapsing后缀的传送见 [[56-lem-noncollapsing-label-trace]]。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-166","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-levy-lifted-reduction.md]]"},{"id":"05941a70d7b43452","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用 [[56-df-levy-lifted-reduction]] 的左线性系统、$\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R$、$z\\in\\operatorname{Vis}(\\operatorname{src}(\\rho))$、$w\\in\\operatorname{Vis}(\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho))$。$\\operatorname{Tr},\\operatorname{wit}$ 经 [[56-lem-edge-expansion-traces]] 引入，展开系统的非collapsing顶点对应见 [[56-lem-noncollapsing-label-trace]]。令 $M=\\operatorname{LTgt}_R(\\rho)$、$Y=\\operatorname{erase}_L(M)$、$a_z=A(\\mathcal E(\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)),\\operatorname{epos}_{\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)}(z))$。"}],"outgoing":["be44d5d262d8e4c8","b2ae6f5d85c77f9b","e1df6cfb55a11bcc"]}